# Line endings are LF in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# Contributions arrive by pull request from Windows, macOS and Linux, and a
# Windows editor with core.autocrlf=false commits CRLF, which turns a one-line
# change into a whole-file diff that nobody can review. Python and Markdown do
# not care about the line ending; reviewers do.
* text=auto eol=lf
